WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.718 --> 00:00:15.279
squeezed through the crowd on the porch outside the lodge.

2
00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.481
Lunch had just ended.

3
00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:21.543
Now all the campers were checking their mailboxes.

4
00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:26.526
"This is the best time of the day," Ivy thought.

5
00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:30.868
In fact, it was the only time of the day that she liked at camp.

6
00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:34.045
She grabbed an envelope from her mailbox.

7
00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:36.707
"It's from my aunt Lydia.

8
00:00:37.527 --> 00:00:38.548
She's awesome.

9
00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.630
She understands me better than my parents do."

10
00:00:43.611 --> 00:00:44.612
Ezra didn't answer.

11
00:00:45.572 --> 00:00:46.873
He was reading a postcard.

12
00:00:48.294 --> 00:00:49.795
Glen held up a blue slip.

13
00:00:50.756 --> 00:00:52.497
"I got a package from my parents.

14
00:00:53.237 --> 00:00:53.998
Let's go get it."

15
00:00:55.779 --> 00:00:57.220
The kids walked to the office.

16
00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.163
"I wrote to Aunt Lydia and told her I hate camp," Ivy said.

17
00:01:05.183 --> 00:01:07.385
"I asked her to rescue me.

18
00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:09.246
Maybe she's on her way."

19
00:01:10.947 --> 00:01:11.888
Ivy read the letter.

20
00:01:11.908 --> 00:01:15.411
"Oh, great.

21
00:01:16.111 --> 00:01:18.773
Aunt Lydia is at a photography workshop!

22
00:01:20.094 --> 00:01:21.355
She's not coming."

23
00:01:22.796 --> 00:01:25.198
She crumpled the letter and tossed it in a trashcan.

24
00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:27.480
"I guess I'm stuck here."

25
00:01:29.136 --> 00:01:31.157
"I don't believe it!"

26
00:01:31.737 --> 00:01:32.357
Ezra said.

27
00:01:32.377 --> 00:01:34.818
"Me neither," Ivy said.

28
00:01:34.838 --> 00:01:38.179
"I'm talking about this postcard."

29
00:01:39.579 --> 00:01:41.280
Ezra showed it to Glen and Ivy.

30
00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:44.060
"My parents are at the beach!

31
00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:48.382
They went on vacation—without me!"

32
00:01:48.402 --> 00:01:52.983
"That looks like a fancy resort," Glen said.

33
00:01:53.003 --> 00:01:55.804
"They're probably having lots of fun."

34
00:01:57.636 --> 00:02:00.957
"Of course they're having fun," Ezra said.

35
00:02:00.977 --> 00:02:03.218
"Without me!"

36
00:02:03.238 --> 00:02:06.378
"Don't worry," Glen said.

37
00:02:06.398 --> 00:02:09.939
"Whatever I got from my parents, I'll share with you."

38
00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.360
The friends walked into the office.

39
00:02:15.141 --> 00:02:16.501
Glen gave the slip to Mrs.

40
00:02:16.561 --> 00:02:18.382
Matsak, the camp secretary.

41
00:02:19.742 --> 00:02:20.962
She handed Glen a box.

42
00:02:23.483 --> 00:02:26.384
"It's already opened," Ivy said, surprised.

43
00:02:27.604 --> 00:02:29.245
Mrs. Matsak rolled her eyes.

44
00:02:29.265 --> 00:02:32.347
"Private checks all the packages.

45
00:02:33.327 --> 00:02:36.789
She wants to make sure nobody is getting anything that breaks the rules."

46
00:02:36.809 --> 00:02:39.451
"Wow, look!"

47
00:02:40.231 --> 00:02:41.472
Glen showed them the box.

48
00:02:42.473 --> 00:02:45.214
It was full of homemade brownies, candy, and gum!

49
00:02:45.234 --> 00:02:51.258
"You can have one treat now, but the rest stays here," Mrs.

50
00:02:51.318 --> 00:02:52.138
Matsak said.

51
00:02:52.158 --> 00:02:55.040
"No food in the cabins.

52
00:02:55.912 --> 00:02:58.174
It attracts ants and wild animals."

53
00:02:59.615 --> 00:03:00.396
Glen sighed.

54
00:03:01.236 --> 00:03:05.900
"Okay." They each took a brownie.

55
00:03:12.906 --> 00:03:16.188
A deliveryman came in, sweating as he pushed a handcart.

56
00:03:17.049 --> 00:03:20.151
On it was a statue of a tall bear carved from wood.

57
00:03:20.171 --> 00:03:22.073
"Where should I put this?"

58
00:03:22.093 --> 00:03:26.252
"Wonderful! It's here," Mrs.

59
00:03:26.292 --> 00:03:27.132
Matsak said.

60
00:03:27.152 --> 00:03:29.413
"Put it in that corner.

61
00:03:30.393 --> 00:03:32.294
Soon it will be placed in the square."

62
00:03:36.075 --> 00:03:38.816
bad it's not a real bear," Ivy whispered.

63
00:03:38.836 --> 00:03:42.097
"They'd have to close camp and send everyone home!"

64
00:03:43.697 --> 00:03:44.797
Glen glanced at Mrs.

65
00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:48.819
Matsak. She was still talking to the deliveryman.

66
00:03:48.839 --> 00:03:53.240
"Psst! Grab some candy from my box!"

67
00:03:54.844 --> 00:03:55.864
Ezra looked nervous.

68
00:03:55.884 --> 00:04:00.406
"Uh "Quick!"

69
00:04:00.846 --> 00:04:01.486
Glen said.

70
00:04:03.066 --> 00:04:04.947
Ivy was already stuffing her pockets.

71
00:04:05.767 --> 00:04:06.607
So was Glen.

72
00:04:07.768 --> 00:04:09.088
Ezra took a few pieces.

73
00:04:09.108 --> 00:04:11.069
"Thanks, Mrs.

74
00:04:11.109 --> 00:04:12.609
Matsak!" Glen said.

75
00:04:12.629 --> 00:04:16.610
As they left the office, even Ezra was giggling.

76
00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:22.472
That night, after evening assembly, the kids walked to the cabins.

77
00:04:24.196 --> 00:04:25.377
Ivy scratched her arm.

78
00:04:25.397 --> 00:04:28.620
"Ugh! More mosquito bites.

79
00:04:29.721 --> 00:04:31.382
I hate this stupid camp!"

80
00:04:32.843 --> 00:04:33.584
Ezra frowned.

81
00:04:33.604 --> 00:04:36.826
"You know where there aren't any mosquitos?

82
00:04:37.887 --> 00:04:39.088
The beach!"

83
00:04:39.108 --> 00:04:42.271
"Cheer up," Glen said.

84
00:04:42.291 --> 00:04:44.152
"I'll give you more candy.

85
00:04:45.593 --> 00:04:48.295
I promised to give some to Buck, Huck, and Chuck too.

86
00:04:49.076 --> 00:04:50.557
They're coming to our cabin for it."

87
00:04:51.718 --> 00:04:53.540
"You're giving candy to the Ucks?

88
00:04:54.348 --> 00:04:55.989
Why?" Ivy asked.

89
00:04:56.009 --> 00:04:58.031
"You should keep it for us."

90
00:04:58.051 --> 00:05:02.995
"Yeah, the Ucks are kind of mean," Ezra said.

91
00:05:04.456 --> 00:05:05.316
Glen smiled.

92
00:05:05.336 --> 00:05:09.479
"Giving away candy will make me the most popular guy at camp!"

93
00:05:11.361 --> 00:05:12.722
They got to the boys' cabin.

94
00:05:12.742 --> 00:05:15.864
"Whoa!" Glen cried.

95
00:05:17.205 --> 00:05:18.046
Ivy gasped.

96
00:05:18.967 --> 00:05:20.508
The door screen was torn open!

97
00:05:24.544 --> 00:05:26.028
Glen slowly opened the door.

98
00:05:28.836 --> 00:05:31.683
Inside, empty candy wrappers littered the floor!
